<title>USA: USG names O'Bryan president, COO.</title>
<headline>USG names O'Bryan president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USG Corp said Tuesday its board of directors elected P. Jack O'Bryan as president and chief operating officer effective June 1.</p>
<p>William Foote previously served as president. Foote will remain as chairman and chief executive officer. The position of chief operating officer had been vacant for about 18 months.</p>
<p>O'Bryan, who joined the company in 1958, previously served as executive vice president of operations for USG.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
